  message: "SATISFIED 2026-07-17 (owner-approved) — 2nd Wave-5 umbrella gate closed (after INV-luhur). Both child families now satisfied: META-luvir (evidence_type axis purity — all 4 members resolved + validator-enforced) and META-jotih (consumers honor test-status via the appropriate single-source chokepoint per pipeline stage — statement amended to reconcile with the WI-popok KEEP; all 3 consumers verified). The 'no-consumer-re-derives' invariant holds across all 3 named granular verdicts: (1) is_resolved — evidence_type is orthogonal, not a resolution proxy (WI-molit KEEP; test_evidence_types.py orthogonality guards); (2) language — synthetic nodes carry language=None + discovery_language, guarded corpus-wide by spec_validator._check_cross_field_coherence (WI-zadot done, ADR-0031); (3) is_test_file — consumers honor the appropriate chokepoint; the entrypoint ranker's broader predicate is a documented KEEP-distinct exception (WI-popok). The reusable umbrella 'no-consumer-re-derives' property test is authored (test_evidence_types.py, PR 72083fb0dd) with a completeness guard. Behavioral evidence across the leaves (WI-bosab/WI-nitob/WI-molit/WI-zadot fixes + guard tests). No consumer re-derives a granular producer verdict via a coarser private heuristic."  # cc6f
